    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-womens-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問　3つの独立小問を型に戻す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "①",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{1}{72}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "②",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{1}{1+x^{2}}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "③",
                "value": "34通り"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "①　『123』を1個のかたまりにする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "9枚すべての並べ方は \\(9!\\) 通りです。条件を満たす並べ方では、1・2・3をこの順で固定した1個のかたまりとして扱います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "そのかたまりと4から9の6枚を合わせた7個を並べるので、条件を満たす並べ方は \\(7!\\) 通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{7!}{9!}=\\frac{1}{72}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "②　逆関数の微分法を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "逆関数では、まず \\(x\\) と \\(y\\) を入れ換えて \\(x=\\tan y\\) とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{1}{dx/dy}=\\cos^2y",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "ここで \\(\\tan y=x\\) なので、三角関数の恒等式を使って \\(x\\) の式へ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos^2y=\\frac{1}{1+\\tan^2y}=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "③　赤白の回数を決めてから順序を数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "赤を \\(x\\) 回、白を \\(y\\) 回取り出すと、得点条件は \\(2x+y=8\\) です。非負整数の組を先に全部並べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x,y)=(0,8),(1,6),(2,4),(3,2),(4,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "各組について、全取り出し回数のどこへ赤を置くかを組合せで数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_8\\mathrm C_0+{}_7\\mathrm C_1+{}_6\\mathrm C_2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "+{}_5\\mathrm C_3+{}_4\\mathrm C_4=34",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　正多面体を断面で考える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "①",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{8}\\pi\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "②",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{27}\\pi\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-womens-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "①　正四面体の外接球",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-tetrahedron-circumsphere",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "辺BCの中点Mと頂点A・Dを通る平面で切ります。点HはAから面BCDへ下ろした垂線の足で、正三角形BCDの重心です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "DM=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "DH=\\frac23DM=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に直角三角形ADHで正四面体の高さを求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AH=\\sqrt{1-DH^2}=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "外接球の半径を \\(r\\) とすると、断面上の直角三角形から次の式が成り立ちます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r^2=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6}{3}-r\\right)^2+\\frac13",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "半径が決まったので球の体積公式へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac43\\pi r^3=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{8}\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "②　正八面体の内接球",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "辺BE・CDの中点M・Nと頂点Aを通る対称な断面で考えます。内接球は、この断面では三角形AMNに内接する円になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-womens-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-octahedron-insphere",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AM=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AO=\\sqrt{AM^2-\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本の断面図の2つの三角形の面積を、内接円の半径 \\(r\\) を高さとして表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}r=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{6}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac43\\pi r^3=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{27}\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　共有点条件から面積の最大へ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "①",
                "value": "\\(0<k<\\frac{9}{4}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "②",
                "value": "\\(h=\\frac{k}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "③",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "①　異なる2交点を判別式で表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "放物線と直線の \\(y\\) を等しくして、共有点の \\(x\\) 座標を与える2次方程式を作ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-x^2+2=-x+k",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x^2-x+k-2=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "異なる2点で交わるので判別式は正です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=1-4(k-2)>0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k<\\frac94",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "問題の条件 \\(k>0\\) と合わせて \\(0<k<9/4\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-womens-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "②　原点と直線の距離",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線を距離公式へ使える一般形に直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x+y-k=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "h=\\frac{|k|}{\\sqrt{1^2+1^2}}=\\frac{|k|}{\\sqrt2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(k>0\\) なので絶対値を外し、\\(h=k/\\sqrt2\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "③　底辺と高さを \\(k\\) で表して最大化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "共有点を \\(P(p,-p+k)\\)、\\(Q(q,-q+k)\\) と置きます。まず底辺PQを \\(|p-q|\\) で表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ=\\sqrt2\\,|p-q|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(p,q\\) は \\(x^2-x+k-2=0\\) の2解なので、解と係数の関係を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p+q=1,\\qquad pq=k-2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|p-q|^2=(p+q)^2-4pq=9-4k",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|p-q|=\\sqrt{9-4k}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "底辺PQと高さ \\(h=k/\\sqrt2\\) から三角形の面積を作ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac12k\\sqrt{9-4k}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(S>0\\) なので、平方根の中 \\(f(k)=9k^2-4k^3\\) を最大にすればよいと分かります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(k)=18k-12k^2=-6k(2k-3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(0<k<9/4\\) では、\\(k=3/2\\) を境に導関数が正から負へ変わるので、ここで最大です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f\\left(\\frac32\\right)=\\frac{27}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_{\\max}=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{27}{4}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-womens-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　90度回転を \\(i\\) 倍で読む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "①",
                "value": "\\(z_\\mathrm{E}=-iz_\\mathrm{B}\\)，\\(z_\\mathrm{G}=iz_\\mathrm{C}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "②",
                "value": "\\(\\mathrm{AM}=\\frac{L}{2}\\)，\\(90^\\circ\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "③",
                "value": "\\(90^\\circ\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "①　正方形の向きから回転方向を決める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点Eは点BをAのまわりに時計回り90度、点Gは点Cを反時計回り90度だけ回転した点です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_E=-iz_B",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_G=iz_C",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "②　中点の式から長さと垂直を同時に読む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点MはEGの中点なので、①の結果を中点公式へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_M=\\frac{z_E+z_G}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_M=\\frac{i}{2}(z_C-z_B)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "絶対値を取ると、\\(|z_C-z_B|=BC=L\\) から長さが分かります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AM=|z_M|=\\frac12|z_C-z_B|=\\frac L2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "また、線分BCを表す差に \\(i\\) を掛けた向きがAMです。\\(i\\) 倍は反時計回り90度の回転なので、AMとBCは垂直です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2z_M}{z_C-z_B}=i",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "③　原点をFへ移して同じ回転を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点Fを原点とします。正方形の向きから、点C・Hを時計回り90度回転すると点G・Kになります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_G=-iz_C,\\qquad z_K=-iz_H",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "線分GKの方向を差で表し、線分CHの方向と比べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_G-z_K=i(z_H-z_C)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{z_G-z_K}{z_H-z_C}=i",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "方向の比が \\(i\\) なので、線分GKは線分CHを90度回転した向きです。したがって、なす角は \\(90^\\circ\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
